# Runway credits per model (falls back to the defaults above when unset).
# Values are Runway's price (docs.dev.runwayml.com/guides/pricing) x 75.
# The base rate is the price at the lowest resolution a model offers (480p, or 360p
# for Gemini Omni Flash 1.1); 720p, 1080p and 4K add the surcharges below. GPT
# Image models are priced at the default "high" quality.
# *_WITH_AUDIO_* applies when audio is on (Seedance and Veo default to audio on);
# it falls back to the model rate without audio when unset.
